   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES19:8d462",
   "off": 578658,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「何をしている！\u0010\b  城への橋は 封鎖だ！\r  ちょっと､目を離した\r  スキにまったく…\u0010\b",
   "en": "\"What do you think you're doing?!\u0010\bThe bridge to the castle is closed! Honestly, I take my eyes off it for one second...\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES19:8d4ba",
   "off": 578746,
   "op": "21",
   "group": "speaker",
   "jp": "兵士\r",
   "en": "Soldier\r",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES19:8d4c1",
   "off": 578753,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「帰った帰った！」\u0010\b",
   "en": "\"Move along, move along!\"\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES19:8d4d9",
   "off": 578777,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "南地区への門は\r閉ざされている\u0010",
   "en": "The gate to the South District is closed.\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES19:8d4fd",
   "off": 578813,
   "op": "21",
   "group": "speaker",
   "jp": "乞食\r",
   "en": "Beggar\r",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES19:8d504",
   "off": 578820,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「…問題は 見かけより\r  ずっと深刻ですぜ\u0010\b  黒幕は 我々の想像を\r  越えたやつかも」\u0010\b",
   "en": "\"...This trouble runs a lot deeper than it looks, mister.\u0010\bWhoever's pulling the strings might be beyond anything we can imagine.\"\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES19:8d55e",
   "off": 578910,
   "op": "21",
   "group": "speaker",
   "jp": "老婆\r",
   "en": "Old Woman\r",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES19:8d565",
   "off": 578917,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「カリフォスの次は\r  アンブローズだって\u0010\b  本当かしら」\u0010",
   "en": "\"They say Ambrose is next, after Caliphos.\u0010\bCan that be true?\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES19:8d5a3",
   "off": 578979,
   "op": "21",
   "group": "speaker",
   "jp": "男\r",
   "en": "Man\r",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES19:8d5a8",
   "off": 578984,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「知識聖堂は 相変らず\r  沈黙したままだ\u0010\b  密かに 工作員を送って\r  いるという噂もあるが…」\u0010",
   "en": "\"The Temple of Knowledge is still keeping silent.\u0010\bThough there's talk they've been sending in agents on the quiet...\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES19:8d609",
   "off": 579081,
   "op": "21",
   "group": "speaker",
   "jp": "老婆\r",
   "en": "Old Woman\r",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES19:8d610",
   "off": 579088,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「医療聖堂の力には感謝\r  しているけど…\u0010\b  治療所は 不気味な\r  雰囲気だよ」\u0010",
   "en": "\"I'm grateful for what the Temple of Medicine can do, but...\u0010\bthat clinic of theirs gives me the creeps.\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES19:8d664",
   "off": 579172,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "掲示板\r「本日の正午をもって\r  全軍の指揮権は\u0010\b  魔導聖堂に移される\r      －王国の娘－」\u0010",
   "en": "Notice board\r\"As of noon today, command of all armed forces\u0010\bpasses to the Temple of Sorcery. -- The Daughter of the Kingdom\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES19:8d6be",
   "off": 579262,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "\b",
   "en": "",
   "kind": "data",
   "status": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES19:8d6c1",
   "off": 579265,
   "op": "21",
   "group": "speaker",
   "jp": "掲示板の前の人\r",
   "en": "Person at the Notice Board\r",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES19:8d6d2",
   "off": 579282,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「いったい\r  どうなってるんだ？」\u0010",
   "en": "\"What on earth is going on?\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES19:8d704",
   "off": 579332,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "フィン\r「リオ！」\u0010\b",
   "en": "Finn\r\"Rio!\"\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES19:8d71c",
   "off": 579356,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "リスプ\r「約束を守ってくれた\r  のね！」\u0010\b",
   "en": "Risp\r\"You kept your promise!\"\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES19:8d754",
   "off": 579412,
   "op": "21",
   "group": "speaker",
   "jp": "リオ\r",
   "en": "Rio\r",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES19:8d75b",
   "off": 579419,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「頼む\u0010\b  エルシノア湖の要塞へ\r  行って アッシュ達を\r  助けてくれ」\u0010",
   "en": "\"I'm beggin' ya...\u0010\bGo to the fortress on Lake Elsinore and help Ash and his people.\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES19:8d7a6",
   "off": 579494,
   "op": "21",
   "group": "speaker",
   "jp": "若者\r",
   "en": "Young Man\r",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES19:8d7ad",
   "off": 579501,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「昨日､魔導聖堂の新しい\r  司祭長が エルシノア湖\u0010\b  へ向かったよ\u0010\b  おおぜい 引き連れて\r  まるで 国王きどり\r  だったな」\u0010",
   "en": "\"Yesterday the new High Priest of the Temple of Sorcery headed off\u0010\bfor Lake Elsinore.\u0010\bHad a whole crowd in tow, too. Strutting about like he was the King himself.\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES19:8d82b",
   "off": 579627,
   "op": "21",
   "group": "speaker",
   "jp": "番兵\r",
   "en": "Guard\r",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES19:8d832",
   "off": 579634,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「北地区への通行は\r  禁止されている」\u0010",
   "en": "\"Passage to the North District is forbidden.\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  }
